This product includes a catalog of 64 integer instructions
(catalog/isa.json). No human wrote those expressions. Each was authored
by a program-synthesis engine that is NOT included in this distribution
and is not part of this product, from example pairs a compiled program printed, and each was
verified by an exhaustive compiled sweep over all 4,294,967,296 int32
inputs against the C reference stored beside it.

The verification discipline, and the limits of what "PROVEN" means here,
are stated in README.md and ATTRIBUTION.md. Verdicts in this software are
produced by a C compiler on the user's machine, not by this software.
